"Show a normal probability plot of the standardized effects. For a saturated "
"model (no error degrees of freedom) of two-level factorial terms, the plot "
"shows the effects with a reference line based on Lenth's (1989) pseudo "
"standard error, and effects larger than its margin of error are marked "
"significant; other saturated models give an error."
